# Closeout - manual package generator structural implementation

**Partial:** implemented the portable bounded preparation/inspection of canonical ZIP STORE/TLV and PACCMP02 envelope framing under accepted M0-M8. Authenticated package generation/validation, real KDF/AEAD, package-purpose signature and certificate/private-key correspondence are NOT implemented or qualified. mp_package_validate explicitly returns CRYPTO_UNAVAILABLE; no mock crypto, fixture key or decoded string becomes authority.

Official executor approved exact4-file source/build/test patch and public-fixture-only correction. Existing source WIP is preserved; only CMakeLists.txt changed among the4730 baseline files. New source files are src/provisioning/manual_package.c/.h and tests/manual_package_test.c. Library is isolated and not linked to runtime/CLI. No accepted normative record or historical format was modified.

Debug/Release selected Windows3MiB and legacy2MiB builds pass with zero final project compiler warnings;17/17 selected suites pass per configuration. The new suite has2077 PUBLIC SYNTHETIC DATA assertions, not authenticated-package/certificate/key tests. Real wrong-password/AEAD/RSA/X509 and KDF Stop tests remain NOT_RUN, not fake PASS. Existing root graph census is unchanged; full activation/provider/kernel remain unqualified. No real key/certificate/private signature, package file, network, CURRENT or admission effect occurred.

